      "description": "filename 'Camera' (0x004A3B50) computes a camera position/rotation and stores it through Vec3CopyToStruct into its own record (+0x4C..0x60) before dispatching sub_54B4D0; it is a per-frame camera transform update, not a camera-object constructor."
    },
    {
      "field": "proposed_name",
      "description": "filename 'ModeDependentSubsystemCall' (0x004A2770) writes one actor record (+0x02 byte, +0x48 dword) and loads a mesh through PitCrewMeshLoader; the name overstates a dispatch role and the 'mode' coupling is speculative."
    },
    {
      "field": "0x004A24D0 calling_convention",
      "description": "sub_4A24D0 is labeled __thiscall but has no `this` object; it is a pure string->int mapper (0..23) over pit-crew animation names and should be treated as cdecl/helper, not an owning thiscall method."
